+- `lake env lean ChowlaCosine/FewSpike.lean`: **PASS**, exit 0, no diagnostics. Log: `lean_p73_scratch/full_check.log`.
+- `lake build` in `lean/`: running; log: `lean_p73_scratch/lake_build.log`.
